{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Daymoon 是一款為嬰兒睡眠而設的聲音機應用，適合需要在午睡、睡前或半夜安撫嬰兒的家長。它內建八種聲音，可挑選一種或混合兩種並各自調整音量，而且毋須註冊帳戶，沒有訂閱與額外推銷。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>八種內建聲音離線播放</h2>\n<p>八種聲音包括粉紅噪音、柔和白噪音、棕色噪音、噓聲、穩定風扇聲、深層噓聲、流水聲與輕柔雨聲；可單選或混合兩種並各自調整音量。支援主畫面小工具、鎖定畫面小工具、Apple Watch、Siri 快捷指令與即時動態，一按即可啟停。所有聲音已內建，離線、鎖屏、靜音模式下仍可持續播放。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-412-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-413-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-414-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-415-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-416-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Daymoon: Baby Sleep Sounds</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T20:57:33.654248+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}